@School_Admission_System_Backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5064

### Create a student
POST {{School_Admission_System_Backend_HostAddress}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "dateOfBirth": "2008-05-14T00:00:00Z"
}

### Get a student by id
GET {{School_Admission_System_Backend_HostAddress}}/students/1
Accept: application/json
